OL,3,AI wasn't going to let others die, says
OL,4,AIndian pilot who opened cockpit door
OL,5,Aduring attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FIndian pilot Smit Machchhar has said he
OL,8,Fopened the cockpit door of the
OL,9,FIsrael-bound Flydubai plane to allow
OL,10,Fpassengers to come in and halt its
OL,11,Frapid descent.
OL,13,FIn a video call with Indian Prime
OL,14,FMinister Narendra Modi, Capt Machchhar
OL,15,Fsaid he was on the ground and still
OL,16,Fbeing attacked by his co-pilot when he
OL,17,Frealised the plane was sinking and he
OL,18,Fhad to do something.
OL,20,F"I was lying on the floor injured but I
OL,21,Ftold myself to go for one last push to
OL,22,Fopen the door from inside," he said.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
